ಹಿಮ:
==Kannada==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|kn|sa|हिम|t=cold, frost, snow}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{kn-IPA|ಹಿಮ}}

===Noun===
{{kn-noun|g=n}}
# [[snow]], [[ice]], [[frost]]
#: {{ux|kn|ಹಿಮಾಲಯದಲ್ಲಿ ಚಳಿಗಾಲದಲ್ಲಿ ಹೆಚ್ಚು '''ಹಿಮ''' ಬೀಳುತ್ತದೆ.|tr=Himālayadalli caḷigāladalli heccu '''hima''' bīḷuttade.|t=A lot of '''snow''' falls in the Himalayas during winter.}}

====Usage notes====
* While often used interchangeably with {{m|kn|ಮಂಜು}}, '''ಹಿಮ''' specifically refers to frozen water (snow/ice). In contrast, {{m|kn|ಮಂಜು}} is a broader term that also encompasses mist, fog, and dew.

====Derived terms====
