* {{l|kn|ಹಿಮಕಣ|tr=himakaṇa|t=snowflake, snow particle}}
* {{l|kn|ಹಿಮಕರಡಿ|tr=himakaraḍi|t=polar bear}}

====See also====
* {{l|kn|ಮಂಜು|tr=manju|t=snow, mist, fog, dew}}

====Declension====
{{kn-decl-a|ಹಿಮ}}

===References===
* {{R:kn:Alar}}

